Z||000001||fiero56||09-08-2000||02:19 PM||||I only used the feature once. Been so long ago, I don't remember what I didn't like about it. Probably because it kept the inbox cleaner, and I check the forum every time I log on anyway.||||reg||1
Z||000002||fropuff||09-08-2000||04:47 PM||||I use it almost all the time.  Every time I get an e-mail, I let them build up for a while, then go to "My Files" and delete all the old e-mails.  I really like the features.  The only time I don't use it is when I post something that isn't that important.  Other than that, every time.  Great option, Cliff!||||reg||1
