Z||000004||DaRkLoRD||09-08-2000||08:11 PM||||I use it every time.. one feature I'd love to see added to the forum is a slight modification to this feature...<P>I think it'd be cool to have a "watch this thread" option, so you could check that box and receive an email notification when there's a new message posted.. this could be used by anyone, not just the original poster.<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||3
Z||000005||Pontiaddict||09-08-2000||09:10 PM||||I don't check my e-mail very often, so it isn't worth doing.<BR>It's best suited for people with e-mail checking programs so they know within a few minutes if someone replied to their post.<BR>Good for emergency advice.||||reg||1
